@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Behavior - Read story columns and task counts
actor "Authorized user" as actor
box "Frontend - Mission Control application" #E0F2FE
  participant "KanbanBoardPage / BoardView" as page
  participant "IBoardService / BoardService" as client
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Api" #D1FADF
  participant "CurrentAccountAuthorization" as access
  participant "BoardsController" as ctrl
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "ValidationBehavior" as validation
  participant "GetKanbanBoardQueryHandler" as handler
  participant "BoardCard" as entity
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Mission Control SQL" as db
end box
actor -> page : Open the Board tab of a Kanban project
page -> page : Set the BoardQuery to the first batch of 25 per column with the current request generation; show skeleton columns; announce "Loading board"
page -> client : boardResource (created once in BoardView's injection context) reads the new query
client -> access : GET /api/workspaces/{id}/board (GetKanbanBoardQuery: the BoardQuery without its generation)
access -> access : L2-002 validate signature, issuer, audience, subject, expiry
access -> db : Read current status, role and credential version
db --> access : Current account access
alt Missing, invalid or expired JWT; deactivated account
  access --> client : 401; audit denial without payloads
  client -> client : sessionInterceptor: a 401 for the current session generation calls SessionService.end(Unauthorized) once
  client --> page : Navigation to sign-in destroys BoardView, which cancels its read; the board is kept as the return route
else Authenticated (every active role reads boards)
  access -> ctrl : Authorized request
  ctrl -> validation : Send GetKanbanBoardQuery through MediatR 12.5.0
  validation -> validation : L2-045 validate status filter and batch size 1-100
  alt Unknown status or batch size outside 1-100
    validation --> ctrl : 400 field / page-size message; nothing read
    ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
    client --> page : Resource status error (400 refusal; repeating it would fail again); keep loaded cards; the column alert, or the board load error on a first read, shows the message with Reload board (new first-batch query); no Retry and no reference ID
  else Valid request
    validation -> handler : Handle GetKanbanBoardQuery
    handler -> db : LoadWorkspaceModeAsync: workspace existence and delivery mode
    db --> handler : Workspace or none
    alt Workspace not found
      handler --> ctrl : 404; nothing read
      ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (not found)
      client --> page : Resource status error (404), on opening or on a later read after the project was deleted; BoardView shows the project's not-found presentation ("Project not found", Back to projects; no Try again or reference ID) and emits notFound
      page -> page : On the first notFound only, KanbanBoardPage calls the layout's refresh(): the header re-reads once and keeps only the breadcrumb
    else Workspace now uses Scrum
      handler --> ctrl : 409 mode-changed; nothing read
      ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (mode changed)
      client --> page : Resource status error (409 mode-changed); BoardView emits modeChanged
      page -> page : KanbanBoardPage calls ProjectLayoutPage.modeChanged(): the header reloads and BoardModeGuard re-matches the Board tab to SprintBoardPage
    else Kanban workspace
      handler -> db : L2-019 LoadKanbanBoardAsync: story-only batches ordered by (Status, Position), story ID tie-breaker, with key and parent epic title; full column counts; sprintsPaused (kept planned or closed sprints)
      handler -> db : Task counts in one set-based aggregate grouped by the batch's story IDs (no per-card query)
      db --> handler : Bounded rows without descriptions, full matching counts, task counts
      handler -> entity : Project key, epic title, status, assignee or Unassigned, completed/total tasks, estimate
      entity --> handler : BoardCard projections
      handler --> ctrl : BoardResult with board ID and board version
      ctrl --> client : 200 with board ID, columns, full counts and versions
      client --> page : Resource status resolved; value holds the BoardResult for the current query
      alt Board ID or query generation no longer current (board left, reloaded, or a move started)
        page -> page : Ignore the value; no state change
      else Current
        page -> page : Fold the value into the latest acknowledged state; counts come from the full totals, not rendered cards; emptyChange when every total becomes or stops being zero
        page --> actor : Board with full counts; empty columns stay visible and say so; Load 25 more where a column has more; paused-sprints alert when sprintsPaused
      end
    end
  end
end
note over page, client
Load more sets the query to the next batch of one column with the current generation;
the resolved batch is appended to that column only and stays while the board is open.
A changed query aborts the superseded read inside the adapter. One board read runs at a time,
and Load more is unavailable while a move is pending.
end note
note over ctrl, db
Unexpected failures return generic 500 plus correlation ID (L2-043).
First load (500, 503, or no response): "We couldn't load the board"
with Try again, which emits retryRequested; KanbanBoardPage calls
the layout's refresh(), so the header, which may have failed too,
rereads with the board. A later batch failure keeps loaded cards and shows a
column alert with Retry for that batch; it replaces Load more, so
focus moves to Retry. Either shows the reference ID only when the
response carried one (500 or 503), never after no response.
Diagnostics exclude secrets and contact payloads.
end note
@enduml
